cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use api-vv-toolkit in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "api-vv-toolkit: requirements-traced API verification with a gated LLM test generator"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit that generates API tests from an OpenAPI contract and written requirements, runs them
  against a live service, and reports a requirements traceability matrix with a CI gate. Optional
  LLM-proposed test cases pass a spec validation gate and are stored with full provenance; the
  repository includes a measured study of that gate against live models.
type: software
authors:
